      "detail": "[goal_mainflow_alignment] Main Flow steps 1 and 5 have the Auctioneer perform the search and the reassignment, while the Goal's canonical success scenario and in-scope actions say the Customer selects the desired customer and reassigns the winning order. The Main Flow therefore conflicts with the Goal's actor/action expectations. (still no supporting evidence after retrieval)",
      "evidence_refs": []
