      "detail": "[mainflow_postconditions_reachability] The postconditions slot is empty even though the goal/success boundary states 'The winning order has been reassigned to the other customer.' Without explicit postcondition(s), the main flow's reassignment step has no defined success state to reach, so the preconditions → trigger → main_flow → postconditions chain is incomplete.",
