      "detail": "[mainflow_trigger_continuity] Main Flow step 3 changes the actor to 'The Customer' ('The Customer clicks the Order History button...'), but the Trigger and Preconditions establish an Auctioneer session, and surrounding main flow steps are performed by the Auctioneer. No actor handoff or login change is modeled, so the main flow contradicts the Trigger and does not continue coherently from the Auctioneer's click.",
